{"title": "Part of the Flock", "pageid": 10476, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Part_of_the_Flock", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Part of the Flock</b> is a passive feature granted while wearing a <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">Whispering Mask</a> that can turn the wearer into Auntie Ethel's Pawn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Auntie Ethel welcomes you, dearie. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ephemeral_Whispers\"> Condition: Ephemeral Whispers </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ephemeral_Whispers_(Condition)\" title=\"Ephemeral Whispers (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Whispers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ephemeral_Whispers_(Condition)\" title=\"Ephemeral Whispers (Condition)\">Ephemeral Whispers</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Tempted by Ethel's whispers.</li>\n<li>This creature must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the start of their turn or be inflicted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hag's Pawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\">Hag's Pawn</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">Whispering Mask</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Servitude (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Servitude (The Blushing Mermaid)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Terror_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Terror (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Terror (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Terror_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Terror (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Terror (The Blushing Mermaid)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Vengeance (The Blushing Mermaid)</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195242\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1364/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15509/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2821/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1066/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817864/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.961      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   46.961      1 -total\n 39.76%   18.672      1 Template:Condition\n 25.79%   12.112      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 22.59%   10.609      2 Templat